Ayu Running Hub contains the Ayu Running report engine migrated from the
`ayu-running-reports` project. The migration preserves the engine's public
contract and sanitized fixtures while intentionally excluding the Codex plugin
wrapper, Skill packaging and local report outputs.

The `running_page` adapter is an interoperability boundary for the public
`coffaye/running_page` data shape. It does not copy the upstream application's
source code or claim ownership of that project.

Third-party dependencies retain their own licenses. No credentials, raw FIT
files, private routes, maps or provider responses are distributed here.

